      <title>What's Trump's strategy now with Iran? To keep things as they are</title>
      <author>Aya Batrawy</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/13/g-s1-153578/whats-trumps-strategy-now-with-iran-to-keep-things-as-they-are</link>
